  "body": {
    "contentType": "text",
    "content": "<p>Hi <strong>James Wilson</strong>, <strong>Alice Johnson</strong>, <strong>Bob Smith</strong>, and <strong>Carol White</strong>,</p><p>We've refreshed the <strong>Cross-Team Collaboration</strong> channel to serve as the central coordination space for engineering, design, and operations this quarter. This hub brings our cross-functional work together so everyone has a single place to follow documents, deadlines, and assignments.</p><p>Here's the purpose of each tab now available in this channel:</p><ul><li><strong>Central Resources</strong> (SharePoint) \u2014 the shared document library where reference materials, specs, and deliverables live.</li><li><strong>Initiative Timeline</strong> (Planner) \u2014 tracks deadlines and milestones so we can follow progress against our quarterly plan.</li><li><strong>Task Overview</strong> (Trello) \u2014 shows assignments and task status so ownership and next steps are always clear.</li></ul><p>Please use this channel as our primary coordination point going forward. Thanks for your collaboration!</p>"
