    "contentType": "text",
    "content": "<p>Hello <at id=\"0\">James Wilson</at>, <at id=\"1\">Alice Johnson</at>, <at id=\"2\">Bob Smith</at>, and <at id=\"3\">Carol White</at>,</p><p>This <strong>Cross-Team Collaboration</strong> channel has been refreshed to serve as the central coordination space for engineering, design, and operations. As we move into this quarter's cross-functional work, this hub brings our teams together so that documents, deadlines, and assignments all live in one shared place.</p><p>To support that, three tabs have been set up:</p><ul><li><strong>Central Resources</strong> (SharePoint) &ndash; the shared home for documents, specs, and reference material so everyone works from the same source of truth.</li><li><strong>Initiative Timeline</strong> (Planner) &ndash; where deadlines and milestones are tracked so we can follow progress against our quarterly plan.</li><li><strong>Task Overview</strong> (Trello) &ndash; where assignments and task status are managed so ownership is always clear.</li></ul><p>Please use this channel as the primary coordination point for our cross-team initiatives. Thank you!</p>"
