    "kb_number": "KB-001",
    "title": "Resolution Guide: Total Rewards fulfillment steps for Q1 2026 Benefits Policy Updates",
    "body": "Resolution Guide: Total Rewards Fulfillment Steps for Q1 2026 Benefits Policy Updates\n\nPurpose\nThis guide summarizes the key Q1 2026 benefits policy changes and answers the most common employee questions received through Total Rewards HR cases, including general benefits inquiries and 401(k) retirement plan questions.\n\nKey Policy Changes for Q1 2026\n1. Benefits Enrollment: The annual enrollment window and qualifying life event procedures have been updated. Employees should review their current elections and confirm dependents.\n2. 401(k) Retirement Plan: Updated contribution limits, employer match details, and vesting information apply for the 2026 plan year.\n3. General Benefits: Clarifications on dental, medical, and other core benefits coverage, eligibility, and effective dates.\n\nCommon Employee Questions and Answers\nQ: How do I confirm my 401(k) contribution and employer match details?\nA: Review your plan summary and contribution elections in the benefits portal. Contact Total Rewards for personalized assistance.\n\nQ: What are the key changes to benefits enrollment for 2026?\nA: Enrollment windows and qualifying life event rules have been updated. Verify your elections during the enrollment period.\n\nQ: Who do I contact for general benefits questions?\nA: Submit a Total Rewards HR case or attend the upcoming Q1 2026 Benefits Policy Update and Q&A Session.\n\nFulfillment Steps\n1. Verify the employee's benefits inquiry category (general benefits or 401(k)).\n2. Provide the relevant policy summary and answer the specific question.\n3. Direct employees to the benefits portal for enrollment actions.\n4. Escalate unresolved questions to the Total Rewards team.\n5. Reference this guide and the upcoming webinar for additional clarity.\n\nNote: Reimbursement-related inquiries are handled separately and are out of scope for this guide.",
    "state": "published",
    "visibility": "external",
    "owner_id": null,
    "org_id": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-09-26T14:37:00.545112",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-26T14:37:00.545112"
  }
}","annotations":null,"meta":null}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}}

