    "contentType": "text",
    "content": "<p>Hi <at id=\"0\">James Wilson</at>, <at id=\"1\">Alice Johnson</at>, <at id=\"2\">Bob Smith</at>, and <at id=\"3\">Carol White</at>,</p><p>This <strong>Cross-Team Collaboration</strong> channel has been refreshed to serve as the central coordination space for engineering, design, and operations. As we move into this quarter's cross-functional work, we needed a single hub where all three disciplines can align on priorities, share context, and stay in sync.</p><p>To support that, we've added three tabs:</p><ul><li><strong>Central Resources</strong> (SharePoint) \u2014 the shared document library where reference materials, specs, and deliverables live.</li><li><strong>Initiative Timeline</strong> (Planner) \u2014 the plan of record for deadlines, milestones, and dependencies across initiatives.</li><li><strong>Task Overview</strong> (Trello) \u2014 the board tracking assignments and day-to-day task ownership.</li></ul><p>Please use this channel as the primary place to follow documents, deadlines, and assignments. Thanks for helping make this quarter's cross-functional collaboration smooth.</p>"
